    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="struct_eigen_types" kindref="compound">EigenTypes</ref></computeroutput> specialisation for double-precision complex matrices. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The general path stays in <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_1_1_a_ring_c_c" kindref="compound">M2::ARingCC</ref></computeroutput>. The Hermitian path drops eigenvalues to <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_1_1_a_ring_r_r" kindref="compound">M2::ARingRR</ref></computeroutput> (Hermitian matrices have real spectrum) while eigenvectors remain <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_1_1_a_ring_c_c" kindref="compound">M2::ARingCC</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
